msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Thanks for the food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gracias por la comida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And thanks for eating it. I'm sorry it＿was nothing special. I completely＿forgot to go grocery shopping.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y gracias por comerla. Perdón por no＿haber hecho nada especial. Se me olvidó＿por completo hacer las compras.」"

msgid "Taiga「I thought your food was special＿enough as is...... Well, I'll forgive you this＿time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「A mí me pareció bastante especial＿así como estaba...... Bueno,＿te perdono esta vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm glad you're as prideful as always.＿Now then, Taiga, let's recap the plan＿for tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me alegra que sigas tan orgullosa＿como siempre. Bien, Taiga, repasemos＿el plan para mañana.」"

msgid "Taiga「What's that? A memo on construction＿paper?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué es eso? ¿Una nota en cartulina?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"A Guide to Ami-chan's Operation＿Venus☆\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「\"Guía para la Operación＿Venus de Ami-chan☆\"」"

msgid "Taiga「......Wait, you wrote that, didn't you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Espera, tú escribiste eso, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She made me! Quit your tsukkomi＿routine. You're on Kitamura duty＿tomorrow, got it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ella me obligó! ¡Deja las burlas!＿Mañana te toca encargarte de Kitamura,＿¿entendido?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh...... Okay.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah...... Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll meet up with Kanou Sumire. You＿take Kitamura to the planetarium and＿get him into a loveseat.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo me reuniré con Kanou Sumire. Tú lleva＿a Kitamura al planetario y haz que se＿siente en un sofá doble.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then, sit next to him in the assigned＿seat and wait there. When Kawashima＿gives the signal, you get up. Got it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Luego siéntate a su lado en el lugar＿asignado y espera. Cuando Kawashima dé＿la señal, te levantas. ¿Entendido?」"

msgid "Taiga「G-Got it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「E-Entendido.」"

msgid "Taiga「Could you kindly not underestimate＿me? Taking Kitamura-kun to a＿loveseat is no big deal......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Podrías hacer el favor de no＿subestimarme? Llevar a Kitamura-kun＿a un sofá doble no es gran cosa......」"

msgid "Taiga「......But what if he says, like, \"I don't＿want to sit next to you, so let's each sit＿in different seats\"?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Pero y si dice algo como: \"No＿quiero sentarme contigo, mejor＿sentémonos en asientos separados\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't lose your nerve, dummy! It's not＿like you. Just be your usual arrogant＿self.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No te acobardes, tonta! Eso＿no es propio de ti. Sé tan arrogante＿como siempre.」"

msgid "Taiga「I-It's a hypothetical question. I need to＿mentally prepare in case of an＿emergency!」"
msgstr "Taiga「E-Es una pregunta hipotética.＿¡Debo prepararme mentalmente por＿si surge una emergencia!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I hope the planetarium's atmosphere＿will help Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espero que el ambiente del planetario＿ayude a Kitamura.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, what's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, ¿qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Argh, I have to stop letting my mind＿get sidetracked! Keep it together, keep＿it together.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Agh, tengo que dejar de distraerme!＿Mantén la calma, mantén la calma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Kitamura will be fine. When it comes＿down to it, he's a man of action.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Kitamura estará bien. A la hora de＿la verdad, es un hombre de acción.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, it'll be fine. Kitamura-kun truly＿did like that hellcat...... and probably＿still does.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, saldrá bien. A Kitamura-kun de＿verdad le gustaba esa arpía......＿y seguro todavía le gusta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If everything works out between them,＿let's treat Kitamura to lunch or＿something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si todo sale bien entre ellos, invitemos＿a Kitamura a almorzar o algo así.」"

msgid "Taiga「Fufu, yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Juju, sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「Taking full advantage of her＿connections, huh. Must be nice.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aprovechando al máximo sus contactos,＿¿eh? Qué suerte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Other than that, we need......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aparte de eso, necesitamos......」"

msgid "Nothing else in particular"
msgstr "Nada más en particular"

msgid "It'll be dark inside, so just in case......"
msgstr "Va a estar oscuro, por si acaso......"

msgid "Maybe I should cover my face......"
msgstr "Quizá debería cubrirme la cara......"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing else in particular...... Right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada más en particular...... ¿Verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「What's with this lack of confidence?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y esa falta de confianza?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Seriously, it'll be fine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......En serio, todo saldrá bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Suffice it to say, let's just bring our＿enthusiasm, okay?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Basta con que vayamos con＿mucho entusiasmo, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Now I'm REALLY concerned.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ahora SÍ que estoy preocupada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm more concerned about whether＿you'll be able to manage Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A mí me preocupa más si podrás＿arreglártelas con Kitamura.」"

msgid "Taiga「Relax and just leave everything to me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Relájate y déjamelo todo a mí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Let's pray she doesn't lose it, then.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Recemos para que no se descontrole,＿entonces.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, since it's going to be dark in＿there, let's take this flashlight just in＿case.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, como estará oscuro ahí dentro,＿llevemos esta linterna por si acaso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Good idea! It's hard to see anything＿once the show starts. That might be＿crazy useful to have.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Buena idea! Cuesta ver algo cuando＿empieza la función. Podría ser＿súper útil tenerla.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Then how should I use it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¿Entonces cómo debería usarla?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In the off chance you decide you want＿to signal someone in the dark, try this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En caso de que necesites hacerle＿una señal a alguien en la oscuridad,＿prueba esto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hm? I don't get it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Mmm? No entiendo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Now I get it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ahora sí entiendo!」"

msgid "Taiga「Got it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entendido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「What's that look for?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y esa mirada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I was just thinking, there's nothing less＿trustworthy than a \"got it\" from you......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo pensaba que no hay nada menos＿confiable que un \"entendido\" tuyo......」"

msgid "Taiga「I, I'll be fine! I'm gonna kick ass＿tomorrow!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡E-Estaré bien! ¡Mañana voy a arrasar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「So don't give me that look!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Así que no me mires así!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「OUCH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AY!」"

msgid "Taiga「Here's the flashlight. Be sure to put it＿in your bag for tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aquí está la linterna. Asegúrate de＿guardarla en tu bolso para mañana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, alright. I believe in you...... Good,＿now our preparations are complete.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, está bien. Creo＿en ti...... Listo, ya terminamos＿los preparativos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Maybe I shouldn't show my face. I think＿I'll need sunglasses.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Quizá no deba mostrar la cara. Creo＿que necesitaré lentes de sol.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I got these from Kawashima...... Do they＿look good on me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me los dio Kawashima......＿¿Me quedan bien?」"

msgid "Taiga「Try them on.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pruébatelos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay. This is my first time wearing＿sunglasses.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien. Es la primera＿vez que uso lentes de sol.」"

msgid "Taiga「......EEEEEEEEEKKKK!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡¡IIIIIIIIIK!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The hell does that mean?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué diablos significa eso?!」"

msgid "Taiga「You're as pale as a murderer!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Estás pálido como un asesino!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「No, don't feel bad about it. It's too late＿for that.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No, no te sientas mal por eso.＿Ya es demasiado tarde.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I've always thought my harsh eyes＿were the reason my face frightens＿people, but I guess I was wrong......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Siempre creí que mi mirada dura hacía＿que mi cara asustara a la gente, pero＿supongo que estaba equivocado......」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, faintly seeing the whites of your＿eyes through the sunglasses makes＿them scarier than usual......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, ver apenas lo blanco de tus ojos＿tras los lentes de sol los hace más＿aterradores de lo normal......」"

msgid "Taiga「B-But it's fine since I know you! They＿look fairly decent on you! ......Probably.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡P-Pero está bien porque te conozco!＿¡Te quedan bastante decentes!＿......Probablemente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-Taiga......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「T-Taiga......」"

msgid "Taiga「EEEEEEEEKKK!! Don't look at me!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡IIIIIIIIK!! ¡No me mires!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......The less I have to use these, the＿better.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Cuanto menos tenga＿que usar estos, mejor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah...... I'll be as careful as possible.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí...... Tendré todo el cuidado posible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Tomorrow morning, I'll call Kitamura＿and tell him that my stomach hurts, so＿I'm having you take my place.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mañana por la mañana llamaré a Kitamura＿y le diré que me duele el estómago,＿así que irás en mi lugar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The rest is up to you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「El resto depende de ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Act natural. If you want this to work,＿don't stiffen up. The more you force it,＿the more it'll show on your face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Actúa natural. Si quieres que funcione,＿no te pongas tensa. Cuanto más lo＿fuerces, más se te notará en la cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And you'll be more likely to mess up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y será más probable que la arruines.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Pull yourself together. We've come so＿far, we can't afford to screw up now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Recomponte. Hemos llegado tan lejos que＿no podemos permitirnos fallar ahora.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「All we can do is get them both in the＿loveseat. It's their problem after that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo único que podemos hacer es sentarlos＿a los dos en el sofá doble. Después＿es problema suyo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you're really not sure, you can switch＿roles with Kawashima if you want.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si de verdad no estás segura,＿puedes cambiar de papel con＿Kawashima si quieres.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As the so-called \"commander,\" she'll be＿doing practically nothing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como la supuesta \"comandante\", ella＿no hará prácticamente nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「Mind your own beeswax! Likewise,＿don't let that woman kick you around＿like some kind of toy!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Métete en tus asuntos! ¡Y tú tampoco＿dejes que esa mujer te maneje a su＿antojo como si fueras un juguete!」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura-kun's future is at stake here!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aquí está en juego el futuro＿de Kitamura-kun!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, all we need now are the＿tickets.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, ahora solo nos faltan＿las entradas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As I recall, Kawashima should have＿enough planetarium tickets for all of＿us by tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si mal no recuerdo, Kawashima debería＿tener entradas del planetario para＿todos nosotros para mañana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「We should be fine as long as we have＿our wallets and the tickets...... Alright,＿just to be sure, let's not take anything」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Con las carteras y las entradas＿bastará...... Bien, por si acaso, ¡no＿llevemos nada」"

msgid "Ryuuji「extra!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「de más!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it does get really dark......＿HOWEVER! Don't use it like crazy in＿the planetarium!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, de verdad oscurece mucho......＿¡PERO NO la uses como loca dentro＿del planetario!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It would be distracting for the other＿customers. Let's refrain from＿overusing it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Distraería a los demás clientes.＿Evitemos usarla en exceso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's decide on some signals and their＿meanings. One flash means \"OK,\" two＿flashes means \"wait\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Acordemos unas señales y sus＿significados. Un destello es \"OK\",＿dos destellos son \"espera\"......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And three flashes means \"help.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y tres destellos significan \"ayuda\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「However! Use it absolutely as little as＿possible, so you don't annoy the other＿customers!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sin embargo! ¡Úsala lo menos posible＿para no molestar a los demás clientes!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Plus, if you use it too much, Kitamura＿and Kanou Sumire might get＿suspicious.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Además, si la usas mucho, Kitamura＿y Kanou Sumire podrían sospechar.」"

msgid "Taiga「Right. After canceling your date with＿Kitamura-kun due to a stomachache,＿it's all over if he sees you at the」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cierto. Tras cancelar tu cita con＿Kitamura-kun por dolor de estómago, todo＿se acaba si te ve en el」"

msgid "Taiga「planetarium.」"
msgstr "Taiga「planetario.」"

msgid "Taiga「T-That's bad, really bad...... Even＿though I should be familiar with your＿face, without realizing, I almost lost」"
msgstr "Taiga「E-Eso es malo, muy malo...... Aunque＿debería estar acostumbrada a tu cara,＿sin darme cuenta casi pierdo el」"

msgid "Taiga「it...... As a young lady, I'm embarrassed.」"
msgstr "Taiga「control...... Como señorita,＿me da vergüenza.」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-Yeah. There might be times when＿you have no choice but to use them.＿Just take care not to make it onto any」"
msgstr "Taiga「S-Sí. Quizá no tengas más remedio que＿usarlos alguna vez. Solo ten cuidado de＿no salir en ningún」"

msgid "Taiga「police reports.」"
msgstr "Taiga「reporte policial.」"
